   After Harmonia destroyed his homeland, Geddoe was brought into the legion of
Harmonia..  He defected from Third-Class Citizenship in Harmonia and fought
alongside the Flame Champion in the Fire Bringer War and helped protect the
Grasslands.  After the war, he wandered the lands until about fourty years
later when he finally rejoined the Harmonian Southern Frontier Defense Force.
He became the leader of the Twelfth Unit and fought during the destruction of
Harmonia by the second Flame Champion.  After the decimation of most of his
friends and the land he had grown to love, he helped create the Chishan council
and was given the title of Chieftan of the Chishan Village.    
~
