   He is an extremely devoted warrior from the Duck Clan.  Once the head of a
family with two children, he was separated from them by his work.  His eldest
son suddenly came down with a sickness and was dying.  However, Jordi was at
battle, and the progress of the battle was unfavorable, so he did not allow
himself to leave the battlefield to be with his son at his deathbed.  This
decision to live as a warrior instead of being with his family at such a time
was a hard one, and after much consideration, he decided to live away from
them.  Later, as a mentor to Hugo, he trained him in the way of the warrior.  
~
