Dominic~
A stubborn older man stands over to the side next to a weapons forge, busy in his work.
~
   Dominic is the old, stubborn proprietor of the armor shop in Vinay del Zexay
and later Budehuc Castle until it was destroyed.  He is known as a fine
craftsman, but he occasionally will sell his customers crap.  Really, his
contemptness for his customers knows few bounds.  He will overcharge his
customers if given the opportunity to, and will beat them with his gear if they
try and steal it.    
~
