yuber~
Yuber~
The general of the Fire Bringer forces hides here within the shadows.
~
   Yuber is a mysterious man who frequently appears in the midst of conflicts.
He has been hired as the general of the Fire Bringer army.  He openly states
that he is not human and anyone who has come into contact with him remark on
his inhuman traits.  He bears the Hachifusa Rune, a true rune of unknown
capabilities.  He feels no affection for his employers and works only with them
to cause chaos.  He harbours a deep hatred toward the True Runes and actively
tries to destroy those who wield their power.    
~
