invincible knight~
the Invincible Knight~
A very powerful knight, seemingly invicible, stands here glaring straight ahead.
~
   The knights armor appears impenetrable.  The only part visible from the
armor is his eyes.  His gaze is hollow, fixed straight ahead without emotion.
If it wasn't for his chest breathing in and out, one could almost confuse him
for a statue.  He was brought here to protect the first born child of Geddoe
during the first Flame Champion war.  Unfortunately, he was unable to stop Luc
from taking the child within the middle of the night.  Ever since that fateful
night, he has kept himself underground, guarding nothing at all.
~
