sarah flame champion~
&01The Flame Champion&00~
&01The champion of flames has been summoned back into this realm and appears to be wreaking havoc upon the villagers.&00
~
   Sarah was born in Harmonia with great inherent magical powers that caused
her to be seen as a witch.  She was raised in a shrine, but later was rescued
by a great destroyer as a child and has lived with him of her life.  She is in
love with him and intends to stick with him to the end.  He brainwashed her
into believing that his cause was the greatest and had her use her powers to
break into the Harmonian jail to slay the Flame Champion.  Upon the demise of
the former Flame Champion, his powers shifted into Sarah.  Her inability to
control her new abilities quickly consumed her and she has been dead-set on the
destruction of the Grasslanders ever since.    
~
